{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "275c200dd9b46321a56ad0316751d711a4428748a4e73a7166cc93fba7a4bacb", "ja": "Rememberブランコ△", "zh": "Remember秋千△", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ca27a2528d8a0b939591aa34f5ec0295b7e009b8b54f2a46046d6e0f4d52388a", "ja": "劇場に戻ってきた亜美達。古い区画が取り壊\nされると聞いて真美も驚き、亜美と思い出を\n語り合う。自分達に何かできないかと言い出\nす一同。昴はプロデューサーに、あの場所で\nライブをやろうと提案するのだった。", "zh": "回到剧场的亚美一行人。听说旧区域要被拆除，\n真美也吃了一惊，并和亚美一起聊起了往事。大家\n开始说，能不能为此做些什么。昴向制作人提议，\n要不要在那个地方举办演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "068198c91f233301363345ef846876fc65753b5c616fe6339fa401925bd98e0a", "ja": "（ミリオンパークの下見は、みんな楽しめたみたいだ。\nこの経験を、上手く仕事にいかさないと……）", "zh": "（大家好像都很享受Million Park的踩点。得想办法把这次经历好好运用到工作中……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "e3e0d0cd7b604dd2a04337e79034071f5f953ff40f4dcae9f5fa87530fc1a457", "ja": "ミリオンパーク、茜ちゃん的にも大満足だったよ！\nみんなはどうだった？", "zh": "百万乐园，小茜也超级满意哦！  \n大家觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "ef4c8505abd16171ede873f3acd76a366ccc632a162ea09c25202580885e1e0c", "ja": "オレも楽しかった♪　なぁ、あの子たちも\n記念式典のイベント、見に来てくれるかな？", "zh": "我也玩得很开心♪ 话说，那些孩子也会来看纪念典礼的活动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "4082935bdcf5be38b72f621a86001e7fba2dbae6c16ab6173dc971f75a0760fc", "ja": "ステージの私たちを見たら、きっとビックリするわね。\n「あっ、あのときのセクシーなお姉さんだ！」って♪", "zh": "要是看到舞台上的我们，她们肯定会大吃一惊吧。\n“啊，是那时候那个性感的大姐姐！”♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "037ef94cf1c47b884a9a9072dd62466487dfbe32cb0c20d0ce2fbcfe04ba4d24", "ja": "亜美も満足したよ～！\n久しぶりに、あの公園で遊べたしね。", "zh": "亚美也满足啦～！\n而且还久违地在那个公园玩了一场呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "8aad92670bb31e6de2b2c130bf7386f42f61d51560c777bd243067a3fca11af7", "ja": "でもあそこ、ホントになくなっちゃうのかな？\n亜美、ずっとあると思ってた……。", "zh": "可是，那里真的会消失吗？\n亚美还以为它会一直存在下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "a6193ea4df20142b8a750fb7131de142d76f0adc5da9df53a4356462cdde277f", "ja": "そうね……どこの公園も、古い遊具は撤去してるし、\n仕方ないことかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "是啊……现在各地公园都在拆除老旧的游乐设施，  \n也许这也是没办法的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "f18b946059605b23c0da123c6661c564cd721a00947d43790bf22ddf1c7980fa", "ja": "ちょいと！　そこの兄ちゃんのダンナ？\nネタはあがってますぜ？　ピチピチの新鮮なネタが！", "zh": "喂！那边那位小哥？已经挖到料啦？还是活蹦乱跳的新鲜料呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "dd3101e9e82a6ba2759dead69d708d6c114dcc984aca950d28448b7da78e1a5f", "ja": "ん？\nああ、なんだ真美か。どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？\n啊，什么嘛，是真美啊。怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "1c9c8a58cf0844a70517b2446ab9cca82d0f25bf2b00e633afb0e397ddf53554", "ja": "みんなで、ミリオンパークに行ってきたんでしょ？\nみさきちに聞いたよ？　真美も行きたかったのに～！", "zh": "你们大家一起去百万乐园了吧？\n我都听美咲姐说了哦？真美也想去嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "881030624aa7624a858c71d3679a757421356b170a65706d5417d59fb9f7ddfe", "ja": "真美、オレたちは遊ぶためだけに行ったんじゃないぜ？\nこれは今度の仕事の、下見だからな！", "zh": "真美，我们可不是只为玩才去的啊？\n这是为了下次工作的踩点，懂吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "d149af1efe5e7db7e7a13b27bcdd8adc2d7725d0b2ef7e3d301583e4b9983a0d", "ja": "そうそう。これはお仕事なのだよ、真美ちゃん！", "zh": "对对。这可是工作哦，真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "408069a8fc2405c6f4796a95d97de16906d38b94000b492f71ad6dc3be1ccf31", "ja": "むぐぐ……！\n兄ちゃん、次は真美もつれてって～！", "zh": "呜咕咕……！\n哥哥，下次也带真美一起去嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cfbd7fc2007dbb4e3b1dbef64b5da8ab6902c657d07c57049af1fe78657d44d2", "ja": "だから、仕事で行ったんだけど……。\nまあ、機会があったらな。", "zh": "所以说，是因为工作才去的……  \n不过，有机会的话就带你去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "b6bcb3ec276a72de71d2c51468cb6b8ea5fb1c39ea8e6f28369e9bde0e6ca9e0", "ja": "ねえねえ真美、知ってた？　ミリオンパークの中にある\nあの公園、もうすぐ壊しちゃうんだって！", "zh": "呐呐，真美，你知道吗？听说百万公园里面的那个公园，马上就要拆掉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "afd9a28afc6702f104701404332ac3dd6b1d0bd17ab3df4346521a8cb9a816a5", "ja": "ええっ！？　それホント？\n真美たち、いっつもあそこで遊んでたのに。", "zh": "诶？！真的吗？\n明明我们总是在那里玩的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "83fe1bfdf1f1c540733b0d99e5d6832cce980d81794e2d75e5d97fb1261d2f6e", "ja": "いろんなコトしたよね～。かけっことか鬼ごっことか、\n花火を使って……あ、これはナイショだった！", "zh": "玩过各种各样的花样呢～比如赛跑啦，捉迷藏啦，\n还有拿烟花来……啊，这个要保密！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5d96ac39799d9a39130f5e9ae1fdfee7db40ba399aa1e336f60931db2d8075f9", "ja": "亜美、真美……花火を使って、一体何を……\nいや、やっぱり聞かないでおこう。", "zh": "亚美、真美……你们用烟花到底做了什么……\n不，还是别问了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "539d11f4df756ffdcf650c467b5c80a19b2786153b6e118cee93293ed6114456", "ja": "それから、ブランコでもよく遊んでたっけ。\n亜美、覚えてる？", "zh": "还有，我们以前也经常一起荡秋千来着。\n亚美，你还记得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "9a7d313ff79c50762d9e2265f2081c0a6b03f80101f0aaec2a82ab1102d56a1c", "ja": "ブランコ？", "zh": "秋千？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "d3518f4e365c67110d44e948b8053a91f3029736b77c776844f80e2dd908e1ff", "ja": "亜美、高くまでこぎすぎて、泣いちゃったじゃん。\nしばらくブランコに近寄らなくなっちゃってさ。", "zh": "亚美，你荡得太高了，都哭出来了嘛。\n有一阵子都不敢靠近秋千了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "ef61659f33a01e8f683a2d7c0bdf90dbe34f1a4b68bb0ec6b275e681782d3235", "ja": "ええっ！？　亜美はブランコで泣いたりしないよ～！\n泣いたのは真美のほうじゃないの？", "zh": "诶！？亜美才不会因为荡秋千荡哭了啦～！\n哭的是真美吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "fe7fda6c9bcbaa40591b37e9d79abd173b498be33d63da78d8392e3d2c935135", "ja": "泣いたのは亜美だよ！　真美はお姉ちゃんだし、\n亜美を守んなきゃって思ったの覚えてるもん！", "zh": "哭的是亜美！我记得当时还想着，真美是姐姐，所以一定要保护亜美才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "937b10e2bd79fa6f8eaa85ad8123e2e611f27b642c6c1f5c8ea1d3b5433aa4e3", "ja": "むむ～……真美がそう言うなら、\nそういうことにしてあげてもいいけどさ～。", "zh": "唔唔～……既然真美都这么说了，\n算成那样也是可以啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9f46814d91376ce914de5f16a9aca2ebf5c9c24d28a707373d1f32065131d9d1", "ja": "ほらほら、ふたりともケンカしない。\nでも、そうか。やっぱり思い出の公園なんだな。", "zh": "好啦好啦，你们两个别吵了。  \n不过，这么说来，果然是充满回忆的公园啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "5efa26aec7935f2396b09c0fd38751159439657e55aa525e8205e1e0d3e87e9c", "ja": "真美たち、いっぱい遊んだからね！\nあーあ、あの公園、なくなっちゃうのか～。", "zh": "我们玩了好多呢！\n啊——那座公园要不见了啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "d53811e74b552cc3651d69acd24aa4070f97635d671cfbd3ed6f869695b671c0", "ja": "今日もたくさんの子どもが遊んでたのよ。\nこのままさよならは、ちょっと寂しいわね……。", "zh": "今天也有好多孩子在玩呢。\n就这样道别，还是让人有点寂寞呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "e992352747450c495ba8f2305e1ebb07fe46a5a47a55f52d7b60811866c5838d", "ja": "おおっと！　しんみりするのは早いよ、このみん！\n茜ちゃんにアイディアがあります。", "zh": "哎呀！现在就开始伤感还太早啦，木实！\n小茜有个主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "f88b414ea26ab61b008189418996baf050944d2a4c7cf64dc24f21afde2fcf8b", "ja": "ここはみんなで、公園の取り壊しに\n反対するしかなくない？　思い出の場所だー！ってさ！", "zh": "这里不就只能大家一起反对拆掉公园了吗？就说“这是承载着大家回忆的地方啊——！”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "06a28eaede87480f951ba64421ed76c4bcd29645daf3cef2d55f64374b4cb583", "ja": "公園の取り壊しに反対か……。", "zh": "反对拆除公园吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "76e9ddfd623cc4b69946e7e7216b4ee00a38f39c99b24a5237c70773a83efcde", "ja": "なら、あの公園でオレたちがライブするとか！　そんで\n盛り上がったら、取り壊し中止とか……ならないかな？", "zh": "那我们在那个公园举办演出怎么样！要是现场气氛热烈起来，说不定就能让他们取消拆除……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "6baa956ce6bb076763cb82f6014e443ee480debd639b441cf8654e8147377f6e", "ja": "昴くん、それ、メッチャいいアイディアだよ！\n兄ちゃん、亜美たちのライブ、あそこでやれないの？", "zh": "昴，这个主意超棒的！\n哥，我们在那里办演唱会行不行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "439e95df4a1cff8f51168625e5f5462e3df5cf8d123744c0e9d15e44444cb465", "ja": "そうだな。ライブはできるかもしれないけど、\n取り壊し中止までいくかどうかは……。", "zh": "是啊。演唱会或许能办，但能不能让拆除计划中止，就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1033_011ami", "source_sha256": "5d605cfec22b74fd0f24d1eec93a351255ca26d2cc8ea9d4c251c64f1637ba9e", "ja": "そんなの、やってみなくちゃわかんないじゃん！\nやらないで後悔するより、やって後悔だよ、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "这种事，不试试看怎么知道嘛！与其不做而后悔，不如做了再后悔啊，哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1034_p", "source_sha256": "dba4bbcdee00f37a22138f594a0add0a41a76ff03ac37159f35629233b259b10", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nじゃあひとまず、あそこでライブを提案してみようか？", "zh": "啊，说得对。\n那先去提议在那里办场演唱会吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1035_011ami", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1036_012mam", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "3125f9987be4742b40d3949bc2fb0df49923e10be45cd5feeb252b3ea34a8948", "ja": "しかし……公園で公演、か。", "zh": "不过……在公园举行公演吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "18b16a111422648ec0285c1f4ff3679be421a144204a97d548e233dee84a7343", "ja": "うわっ、{$P$}ちゃん言っちゃった！\n茜ちゃんですら言わなかったのに、言っちゃった！", "zh": "哇，{$P$}居然说出来了！\n连小茜都没说出口，居然给说出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0133_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "3028fbe42afcd2220f4a7987a6e7307d9a50a23220829a8fbd16abd1b6e7f8e5", "ja": "（公園の事で、みんな、やる気になっているみたいだ。\nここはひとまず、見守ってみよう！）", "zh": "（大家好像都因为公园的事干劲十足。这里还是先静观其变吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
